{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Friends Like These is an adorable two-player local co-op adventure that makes sure no-one player is more important than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/cinema.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Silly Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh no! While cruising through space to Party Planet you\u2019ve been hit by an asteroid and crash land on Super Chill World. Your friends don\u2019t know they\u2019re on the wrong planet and have started the biggest party ever. It\u2019s up to you and your bestie to stop them from trashing the place by teleporting them back to the party bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Rock_band.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Role Swap Till You Drop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both players control the same ship; one flying, the other shooting. The roles switch based on the part of the environment you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Boss_Chase.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Match the colour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to send your friends back to the bus, you'll need to match your magical teleport bullet colour to their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because we all see colour differently, you are able to change the important colours to help make it clearer for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Core-Loop.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Busy Friends Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry if you don\u2019t have anybody to play with, Busy Friends mode is perfect for you. There are two ways to enjoy single player. The hard way and easy way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard is perfect for going solo but keeping the same sense of confusion that two players would feel, as your left and right hands argue for control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy controls are perfect if you just want to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498890?t=1743039612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498890?t=1743039612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/862f44d39fd1e37f8a50262613b3bc598636edf7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743039612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/862f44d39fd1e37f8a50262613b3bc598636edf7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743039612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Friends Like These is an adorable two-player local co-op adventure that makes sure no-one player is more important than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/cinema.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Silly Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh no! While cruising through space to Party Planet you\u2019ve been hit by an asteroid and crash land on Super Chill World. Your friends don\u2019t know they\u2019re on the wrong planet and have started the biggest party ever. It\u2019s up to you and your bestie to stop them from trashing the place by teleporting them back to the party bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Rock_band.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Role Swap Till You Drop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both players control the same ship; one flying, the other shooting. The roles switch based on the part of the environment you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Boss_Chase.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Match the colour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to send your friends back to the bus, you'll need to match your magical teleport bullet colour to their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because we all see colour differently, you are able to change the important colours to help make it clearer for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/Core-Loop.gif?t=1743039612\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Busy Friends Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry if you don\u2019t have anybody to play with, Busy Friends mode is perfect for you. There are two ways to enjoy single player. The hard way and easy way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard is perfect for going solo but keeping the same sense of confusion that two players would feel, as your left and right hands argue for control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy controls are perfect if you just want to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Shy Kids Club"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/header.jpg?t=1743039612","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093366,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093366/movie480.mp4?t=1743039610","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093366/movie_max.mp4?t=1743039610"},"name":"Early Look Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093366/9825c5b5f7f811793e8001f1281ee8f96d19c38f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743039610","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093366/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743039610","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093366/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743039610"}}],"name":"With Friends Like These","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or better</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Shy Kids Club"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/64267d595008027966eb75507dea7415a7d5c8f5/ss_64267d595008027966eb75507